/* =============================================================================
   2. REELS  →  shown in the "01 Reels" tab of Selected Work
   -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Each reel is one card. There are 6 — add or remove entries and the grid
   adjusts automatically.

   HOW TO FILL EACH FIELD:

   title       →  CHANGE THE TITLE. Plain text, shown under the thumbnail.

   youtubeUrl  →  PASTE YOUR YOUTUBE URL HERE. Any normal YouTube link works,
                  for example:
                    https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XXXXXXXXXXX
                    https://youtu.be/XXXXXXXXXXX
                    https://www.youtube.com/shorts/XXXXXXXXXXX
                  Leave it as "" and the card will show a placeholder with a
                  "Video coming soon" message instead of a broken link — an
                  empty or mistyped URL will never break the website.

   thumbnail   →  UPLOAD/REPLACE THE THUMBNAIL IMAGE HERE. Paste an image URL
                  (the easiest option is uploading the image to your website
                  host or an image host and pasting the link it gives you).
                  Leave it as "" and the site will automatically use that
                  video's own YouTube thumbnail instead — so filling in
                  youtubeUrl alone is enough to get a working card.

   views       →  CHANGE THE VIEW / RESULT COUNT. Free text, e.g. "128K views"
                  or "2.1M views". Leave it as "" to hide this line entirely.
   ============================================================================= */
